+## Workspace ownership (P1)
+
+`WorkspaceSession` owns one workspace runtime. `WorkspaceRegistry` keeps weak
+window ownership information, while `WindowCoordinator` owns sessions loaded
+in one window. Selecting an already-owned workspace activates its existing
+window. Closing a window awaits every loaded session, including hidden ones,
+and is idempotent. P2 saves named configuration with revision checks and backup recovery. Closing prepares every affected save before releasing runtimes; cancellation preserves all loaded work. Restart loads the last active configuration and keeps Shell/SSH idle until an explicit start.
+
